WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.672 --> 00:00:14.173
so happy to see you all!"

2
00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:15.193
Roxy said.

3
00:00:15.873 --> 00:00:17.894
Her mom, Terrell, Bippo, and Dr.

4
00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:19.315
Odd were on her watch screen.

5
00:00:20.055 --> 00:00:21.135
"Where are you?"

6
00:00:21.636 --> 00:00:22.456
her mom asked.

7
00:00:23.176 --> 00:00:23.956
Roxy frowned.

8
00:00:23.976 --> 00:00:26.758
"I'm trapped somewhere in outer space.

9
00:00:27.198 --> 00:00:30.819
An alien is making me fight in a dumb battle contest."

10
00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.340
"Oh no!"

11
00:00:32.928 --> 00:00:33.649
her mom said.

12
00:00:34.229 --> 00:00:35.009
Cozlin waved.

13
00:00:35.029 --> 00:00:37.251
"Don't worry, Roxy's mom.

14
00:00:37.691 --> 00:00:39.532
We'll figure out how to escape."

15
00:00:39.552 --> 00:00:41.113
"Kid Comet!"

16
00:00:41.453 --> 00:00:42.113
Terrell said.

17
00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.854
"I'm here too!"

18
00:00:44.274 --> 00:00:45.115
Wukong said.

19
00:00:45.135 --> 00:00:49.217
"We have big problems on Earth, Rocket Girl," Dr.

20
00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:49.858
Odd said.

21
00:00:49.878 --> 00:00:51.999
"Earthquakes keep happening."

22
00:00:52.599 --> 00:00:54.140
"Shaking, us!"

23
00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.341
Bippo said.

24
00:00:55.361 --> 00:00:57.642
"I know," Roxy said.

25
00:00:57.662 --> 00:00:59.383
"A dragon told us."

26
00:00:59.983 --> 00:01:01.244
Her mom's eyes went wide.

27
00:01:01.816 --> 00:01:02.797
"A dragon?"

28
00:01:02.817 --> 00:01:06.219
"It's a long story," Roxy said.

29
00:01:06.239 --> 00:01:10.382
"But the dragon said the gold was placed underground by Buddha.

30
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:12.824
Then somebody stole it."

31
00:01:13.304 --> 00:01:15.486
She glared at Cozlin, who grinned sheepishly.

32
00:01:15.506 --> 00:01:18.167
"How do we stop the earthquakes?"

33
00:01:18.668 --> 00:01:19.608
Dr. Odd asked.

34
00:01:19.628 --> 00:01:22.991
"We have to return the gold," Roxy said.

35
00:01:23.531 --> 00:01:24.852
Dr. Odd scratched his head.

36
00:01:24.872 --> 00:01:30.216
"How?" "Find the bodhisattva Guanyin," Wukong said.

37
00:01:30.768 --> 00:01:32.089
"She always helps me."

38
00:01:32.109 --> 00:01:35.732
"There's no need for that," Cozlin said.

39
00:01:35.752 --> 00:01:40.156
"Zark, the portal operator on Delkor, can help."

40
00:01:40.917 --> 00:01:42.978
She quickly shared his contact information.

41
00:01:47.502 --> 00:01:48.363
Dr. Odd said.

42
00:01:48.383 --> 00:01:50.424
"We will—" Rumble!

43
00:01:50.845 --> 00:01:52.946
Rumble! The screen went blank.

44
00:01:54.147 --> 00:01:55.929
The mobile lab shook, knocking Dr.

45
00:01:56.049 --> 00:01:56.950
Odd out of his chair.

46
00:01:57.590 --> 00:01:59.612
When the shaking stopped, he got back up.

47
00:02:00.064 --> 00:02:00.724
Terrell frowned.

48
00:02:01.345 --> 00:02:02.685
"We lost the connection!"

49
00:02:02.705 --> 00:02:06.727
"At least we know Roxy is okay," her mom said.

50
00:02:06.747 --> 00:02:09.728
"And now I can locate her," Dr.

51
00:02:09.828 --> 00:02:10.308
Odd said.

52
00:02:10.328 --> 00:02:12.449
"But first I'll call Zark."

53
00:02:12.909 --> 00:02:14.250
He typed in several digits.

54
00:02:16.251 --> 00:02:18.151
A Delkorian appeared on a computer screen.

55
00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:20.472
"Hello." "Hey!"

56
00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:21.493
Terrell said.

57
00:02:21.513 --> 00:02:23.614
"We're friends with Kid Comet.

58
00:02:24.094 --> 00:02:26.755
She said you can help us return some gold to Earth."

59
00:02:27.655 --> 00:02:28.956
Zark rubbed the back of his neck.

60
00:02:29.568 --> 00:02:31.110
"I'm sorry, but I can't help you."

61
00:02:31.130 --> 00:02:32.711
"Why not?"

62
00:02:33.091 --> 00:02:33.912
Dr. Odd said.

63
00:02:33.932 --> 00:02:35.454
"This is important!

64
00:02:35.894 --> 00:02:37.976
Earthquakes are destroying our city.

65
00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:41.319
They won't stop unless we return that gold!"

66
00:02:42.059 --> 00:02:42.860
Zark sighed.

67
00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.502
"I'd like to help, but the gold is gone.

68
00:02:45.963 --> 00:02:47.524
It's just vanished!"

69
00:02:47.544 --> 00:02:51.448
"Now what will we do?"

70
00:02:51.888 --> 00:02:53.129
Terrell asked after Dr.

71
00:02:53.209 --> 00:02:53.730
Odd hung up.

72
00:02:54.671 --> 00:02:55.952
Roxy's mom had an idea.

73
00:02:56.644 --> 00:02:59.966
"Wukong said to find the bodhisattva Guanyin."

74
00:03:00.646 --> 00:03:01.647
Terrell shook his head.

75
00:03:01.667 --> 00:03:03.868
"She's in a different universe.

76
00:03:04.429 --> 00:03:05.629
And we don't have a portal."

77
00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:07.450
Dr. Odd smiled.

78
00:03:07.470 --> 00:03:08.951
"Actually, we do.

79
00:03:09.471 --> 00:03:12.093
I traveled all over, searching for the Groonians.

80
00:03:13.694 --> 00:03:14.935
I still haven't found them.

81
00:03:15.455 --> 00:03:20.778
But I did visit Hulzar, where I learned everything about portal technology."

82
00:03:21.518 --> 00:03:22.259
Bippo pointed.

83
00:03:27.208 --> 00:03:27.668
"Smart, him!"

84
00:03:27.708 --> 00:03:32.171
"Attention!" The fighting stopped as the Battle Master's voice came over the loudspeaker.

85
00:03:32.191 --> 00:03:36.353
"The next round of battles will be two-on-two.

86
00:03:37.094 --> 00:03:39.495
You have one minute to select a partner."

87
00:03:40.336 --> 00:03:43.077
Roxy, Cozlin, and Wukong looked at one another.

88
00:03:43.718 --> 00:03:45.278
Cozlin put her hands on her hips.

89
00:03:45.999 --> 00:03:47.500
"Well, Rocket Girl?

90
00:03:47.840 --> 00:03:49.541
Who are you going to choose?"

91
00:03:50.381 --> 00:03:51.902
"Me," Wukong said.

92
00:03:51.922 --> 00:03:54.464
"I'm the most powerful being here."

93
00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.904
"I can shoot lasers from my hands," Cozlin said.

94
00:03:59.464 --> 00:04:00.365
Wukong shrugged.

95
00:04:00.385 --> 00:04:02.387
"I have my iron bar.

96
00:04:02.647 --> 00:04:04.909
And I can turn into—" Voop!

97
00:04:05.610 --> 00:04:07.211
Cozlin walked through Wukong.

98
00:04:07.231 --> 00:04:09.533
"Hey!" Wukong said.

99
00:04:09.553 --> 00:04:10.935
"Don't do that!"

100
00:04:10.955 --> 00:04:13.297
"Please, stop arguing."

101
00:04:13.797 --> 00:04:14.598
Roxy sighed.

102
00:04:14.618 --> 00:04:17.681
"I wish I didn't have to choose.

103
00:04:18.281 --> 00:04:20.163
But I guess I'll go with Wukong."

104
00:04:22.029 --> 00:04:25.046
Cozlin gave her a hurt look and then hurried over to Sapphire.
